<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_abd6a715-3e29-4486-86fe-be9ca2e3b914"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, unless the context or subject-matter
otherwise indicates or requires:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c9ef3c03-13e9-4693-99a8-f61bc97f5154" id="def.theCourt"><b><i>the
Court</i></b></defterm> means the Supreme Court.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_f129f49c-356a-4d0f-84e4-6b56acb9aae9"
id="def.Judge"><b><i>Judge</i></b></defterm> means a Judge of the
Court.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


